*   $\frac{1}{729} = \frac{1}{729}$ ($3^6 / 3^6 = 3^0 = 1$)

Now sum the numerators:
$$Sum = \frac{243 + 81 + 27 + 9 + 3 + 1}{729}$$
Performing the addition from largest to smallest (or grouping digits):
$$243 + 81 = 324$$
$$324 + 27 = 351$$
$$351 + 9 = 360$$
$$360 + 3 = 363$$
$$363 + 1 = 364$$
